WEBVTT

00:01.481 --> 00:02.818
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.842 --> 00:04.177
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.201 --> 00:07.417
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.441 --> 00:13.001
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.001 --> 01:30.961
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.121 --> 01:34.361
=Episode 3=

01:37.361 --> 01:38.361
Your Highness.

01:38.441 --> 01:39.441
Where are your people?

01:39.760 --> 01:40.521
They are of no help

01:40.560 --> 01:41.641
in the brothel.

01:41.961 --> 01:42.961
I asked them to leave.

01:43.641 --> 01:44.081
Your Highness,

01:44.361 --> 01:46.521
is this the divine horse you just got?

01:47.040 --> 01:48.040
No.

01:48.081 --> 01:49.081
Just an aged horse.

01:49.680 --> 01:51.280
We have plenty of

01:51.521 --> 01:52.680
good horses at the mansion.

01:52.961 --> 01:53.521
Do you want to change one?

01:53.760 --> 01:54.760
I'm used to it.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.280
Alright.

01:55.320 --> 01:56.040
Then I won't talk nonsense.

01:56.120 --> 01:57.120
Let's go now.

01:59.961 --> 02:01.521
Your Highness,
why not get on the horse?

02:02.081 --> 02:03.441
It doesn't allow me to ride.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.280
Are you in a rush?

02:05.320 --> 02:06.320
No.

02:06.521 --> 02:07.521
Alright,

02:07.560 --> 02:08.320
I haven't been back for three years.

02:08.441 --> 02:08.840
Let's take our time

02:09.280 --> 02:10.280
and walk around.

02:10.361 --> 02:11.361
Come on.

02:18.840 --> 02:19.840
Jiang Ni, keep up.

02:23.201 --> 02:29.401
(Tingchao Pavilion)

02:36.241 --> 02:37.241
Did you catch any fish?

02:37.560 --> 02:38.600
I've caught several.

02:39.081 --> 02:40.081
That's enough.

02:40.201 --> 02:41.201
Go back to your room.

02:41.680 --> 02:42.680
No, I can't.

02:42.880 --> 02:44.240
We're eating grilled fish tonight.

02:46.521 --> 02:47.521
You guys

02:48.041 --> 02:49.041
may leave now.

02:52.600 --> 02:53.600
Not you.

02:53.801 --> 02:54.801
Stay here.

02:59.081 --> 03:00.081
Son, look.

03:00.521 --> 03:02.801
There are abundant water plants
over there.

03:03.081 --> 03:04.321
There must be a lot of fish.

03:04.481 --> 03:05.641
Go fishing over there.

03:07.321 --> 03:07.961
Really?

03:08.160 --> 03:09.201
I never lied to you.

03:12.361 --> 03:13.361
Alright.

03:21.321 --> 03:22.321
Sit down.

03:29.560 --> 03:30.560
Thank you

03:31.361 --> 03:32.361
for these three years.

03:33.160 --> 03:34.656
My Lord, you have already
said thank you.

03:34.680 --> 03:35.880
That's not enough.

03:36.560 --> 03:37.801
I've been thinking that

03:38.961 --> 03:40.081
I should give you something.

03:40.641 --> 03:41.641
Meat is fine.

03:42.481 --> 03:43.681
Streaky pork will be the best.

03:51.481 --> 03:52.481
Do you really want to

03:52.880 --> 03:54.480
be a horseman for the rest of your life?

03:58.201 --> 03:59.201
As long as you want,

03:59.801 --> 04:01.361
North Liang can help you

04:01.921 --> 04:03.120
to get back to your business

04:03.761 --> 04:05.961
and reproduce the mien
of Jian Jiuhuang.

04:15.880 --> 04:17.040
My Lord, to be honest,

04:18.641 --> 04:19.641
I've thought about it.

04:20.600 --> 04:21.600
I've had this

04:21.800 --> 04:23.360
with me during these years.

04:24.081 --> 04:26.121
I always felt like I couldn't
let go of my old self.

04:26.881 --> 04:28.360
I've messed with myself for years

04:28.920 --> 04:30.081
without much peace.

04:30.600 --> 04:32.200
Then, let your sword
come out of the box.

04:37.121 --> 04:38.921
After the three-year travel
with Young Master,

04:40.561 --> 04:41.561
I've got

04:42.641 --> 04:43.641
my inner peace.

04:47.201 --> 04:48.441
My Lord, you happen to be here,

04:49.001 --> 04:50.001
please

04:50.761 --> 04:51.761
bear witness for me.

04:53.961 --> 04:55.001
Jian Jiuhuang

04:57.121 --> 04:58.641
was already dead

05:00.600 --> 05:01.600
on the city wall.

05:03.521 --> 05:04.521
From now on,

05:04.720 --> 05:06.800
I'm just Old Huang
by Young Master's side.

05:38.321 --> 05:39.920
Tell me when the fish are grilled.

05:49.720 --> 05:50.720
His Highness is back!

05:50.881 --> 05:51.881
Don't let him see you.

05:52.321 --> 05:53.480
He is lustful.

05:53.720 --> 05:54.681
I heard that he has taken

05:54.720 --> 05:56.120
a lot of girls back to his mansion.

05:56.521 --> 05:57.641
He looks handsome.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.681
It's not a bad choice.

06:00.561 --> 06:01.721
This servant also looks cute.

06:02.081 --> 06:03.081
So pretty.

06:04.321 --> 06:05.761
Where does this cute boy come from?

06:06.040 --> 06:07.081
You don't understand.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.040
But he doesn't look manly.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.641
What's wrong with your eyes?

06:10.720 --> 06:12.120
How can a man be so pretty like me?

06:12.641 --> 06:14.121
We're going to a brothel.

06:14.360 --> 06:16.081
It's not appropriate
to say you're a girl.

06:22.800 --> 06:23.880
Your Highness, you're back!

06:24.001 --> 06:25.040
It's been years.

06:25.081 --> 06:26.881
All the girls are missing you
all the time.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.240
Don't talk too much.

06:28.441 --> 06:29.681
Lead the horse to the backyard.

06:29.840 --> 06:30.840
Go.

06:35.480 --> 06:36.480
I finished it.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.800
That's fast.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.000
You're pretty like Old Huang.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.480
We have no fruit now.

06:40.681 --> 06:41.681
I don't need to go in.

06:43.160 --> 06:43.537
Then you're

06:43.561 --> 06:44.201
the fruit.

06:44.400 --> 06:44.681
Come on.

06:45.201 --> 06:45.480
What?

06:45.641 --> 06:46.641
What do you mean?

06:46.881 --> 06:48.360
I'll pay you, OK?

06:48.441 --> 06:49.857
(Lingzhou Zijin Brothel)

06:49.881 --> 06:51.696
(Zijin Brothel)
What game is His Highness playing?

06:51.720 --> 06:53.201
He even brings two girls here.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.040
How dare you

06:58.761 --> 07:00.521
gossip about His Highness?

07:02.360 --> 07:03.360
I'm sorry.

07:51.641 --> 07:52.641
How much do these cost?

07:54.561 --> 07:55.561
A dozen taels, I guess.

07:56.321 --> 07:57.321
A dozen?

07:58.160 --> 07:59.240
These are cheap ones.

08:02.521 --> 08:03.521
Your Highness,

08:04.001 --> 08:05.360
the new belle is here.

08:15.641 --> 08:16.641
What's your name?

08:16.841 --> 08:17.696
(Belle of Zijin Brothel Yu Youwei)

08:17.720 --> 08:18.720
Yu Youwei.

08:19.441 --> 08:20.441
Nice name.

08:22.961 --> 08:24.681
How honored I am

08:25.761 --> 08:26.961
to meet

08:28.201 --> 08:29.360
Your Highness here today.

08:35.801 --> 08:36.801
You know who I am?

08:40.520 --> 08:41.921
General Chu told me.

08:42.600 --> 08:43.600
Your Highness,

08:44.600 --> 08:46.520
her sword dance is famous.

08:47.041 --> 08:49.000
You can't see her waist
if not the dance.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.720
Then,

08:53.120 --> 08:54.441
Miss Yu, please.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.600
I can dance

08:57.161 --> 08:58.161
two kinds of sword dance.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.120
One is

09:00.880 --> 09:01.921
for the

09:02.401 --> 09:03.880
common people.

09:06.561 --> 09:07.640
What about the other one?

09:08.600 --> 09:09.681
The other

09:10.161 --> 09:11.640
is only

09:12.360 --> 09:14.000
for my lover.

09:16.520 --> 09:17.520
Why?

09:17.921 --> 09:19.640
Because the latter one

09:21.120 --> 09:22.321
is pretty flirtatious.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.441
That's great.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.840
If Your Highness can come
with me to the backyard,

09:35.081 --> 09:36.480
then I can dance

09:37.681 --> 09:39.401
to Your Highness alone.

09:47.201 --> 09:48.201
Let's go

09:48.720 --> 09:50.760
and see how flirtatious it is.

10:37.720 --> 10:39.041
Double blades?

10:40.161 --> 10:41.161
It's not common.

11:15.801 --> 11:16.841
The tea is freshly brewed.

11:17.720 --> 11:19.480
Your Highness, do you wanna try it?

11:19.840 --> 11:20.840
No.

11:21.401 --> 11:23.480
I just want to see your dance.

11:24.281 --> 11:25.401
The flirtatious one.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.760
West Chu's Sword Dance?

13:36.081 --> 13:37.081
It's sharpened?

14:10.681 --> 14:12.361
(Chu)

14:39.880 --> 14:41.480
You shouldn't have made use
of the dance.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.616
The Halberd Troops of West Chu

14:43.640 --> 14:45.600
outside Lingzhou City tried to kill me.

14:47.281 --> 14:48.081
What you did would only

14:48.120 --> 14:51.081
remind me of West Chu's Sword Dance.

14:52.441 --> 14:54.441
Assassination doesn't need
to be so complicated.

15:01.600 --> 15:02.600
Are you from the Chu?

15:10.561 --> 15:11.641
Why do you want to kill me?

15:12.520 --> 15:13.720
Xu Xiao wiped out the Chu.

15:14.240 --> 15:15.321
Who else should I kill?

15:20.240 --> 15:21.840
That's not a right way to talk about it.

15:22.561 --> 15:24.601
That was a national war between
Liyang and West Chu,

15:24.921 --> 15:25.921
not a private feud.

15:26.561 --> 15:27.976
Even if Xu Xiao had not led the troops,

15:28.000 --> 15:30.000
someone else would have
wiped out West Chu as well.

15:31.041 --> 15:31.720
If you want to take revenge,

15:31.760 --> 15:33.360
you should go to Liyang's royal family.

15:34.201 --> 15:36.096
There is no reason for you
to keep targeting my family.

15:36.120 --> 15:37.720
That's not only a national war.

15:39.161 --> 15:40.521
Then what else do you think it is?

15:40.681 --> 15:41.520
If the Great Chu was defeated,

15:41.640 --> 15:42.640
we could surrender.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.321
But what did Xu Xiao do?

15:45.161 --> 15:46.481
He led his troops into the palace

15:46.801 --> 15:48.520
and killed His Majesty and the Empress!

15:49.000 --> 15:50.000
Not only that,

15:51.240 --> 15:54.760
hundreds of people in the palace
all didn't survive,

15:54.921 --> 15:57.600
even the young princess was beheaded!

15:59.840 --> 16:01.360
Is she highly skilled in martial arts?

16:01.961 --> 16:03.001
She can't do martial arts.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.360
Just sword dance.

16:05.161 --> 16:05.640
That's good.

16:06.041 --> 16:07.281
Please take Jiang Ni here.

16:11.281 --> 16:11.640
Wait!

16:11.720 --> 16:12.720
Even if I can't kill you,

16:13.240 --> 16:14.657
I will never let myself be humiliated!

16:14.681 --> 16:15.880
Can you wait for a moment?

16:16.161 --> 16:17.161
Until that person comes.

16:20.081 --> 16:21.201
Why should I go?

16:22.520 --> 16:23.520
You can ask him yourself.

16:27.401 --> 16:28.880
Did he get horny?

16:44.321 --> 16:45.720
It's really an assassination!

16:47.240 --> 16:48.161
Look!

16:48.201 --> 16:49.297
Even the girl in the brothel

16:49.321 --> 16:51.041
can't stand such a rascal like you.

16:51.321 --> 16:53.081
That's the common wish!

16:54.401 --> 16:55.761
She danced West Chu's Sword Dance.

17:03.321 --> 17:04.321
You're from the Chu?

17:05.161 --> 17:06.240
Show her

17:07.240 --> 17:08.240
your dagger.

17:12.881 --> 17:14.041
She is about to kill herself.

17:14.961 --> 17:15.961
Don't bother.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.240
I can do it myself.

17:19.401 --> 17:20.401
Wait a second!

17:23.121 --> 17:24.681
Since you know West Chu's Sword Dance,

17:25.441 --> 17:26.881
you must not be a civilian, are you?

17:28.161 --> 17:29.720
My father was an official.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.520
My mother was the sword servant.

17:33.881 --> 17:35.560
Then you must know this dagger.

17:42.560 --> 17:43.560
Divine Token?

17:44.361 --> 17:45.361
You said

17:45.520 --> 17:47.760
the young princess was beheaded.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.240
Have you ever seen her head?

17:57.401 --> 17:58.401
What do you mean?

17:58.681 --> 18:00.601
Xu Xiao spread the rumor
of the beheading.

18:01.080 --> 18:02.080
The Princess is not dead.

18:03.641 --> 18:04.681
She's standing right here.

18:09.760 --> 18:11.440
Have you ever seen the Empress
of West Chu?

18:18.401 --> 18:19.480
You're really…?

18:20.240 --> 18:22.161
They say I look like my mother.

18:24.720 --> 18:25.720
It seems to be true now.

18:32.681 --> 18:33.681
I'm Jiang Ni,

18:36.280 --> 18:37.600
princess of the conquered nation.

18:42.641 --> 18:43.641
Your Highness!

19:02.801 --> 19:07.361
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

19:09.320 --> 19:10.320
Your Highness.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.080
You're back.

19:12.201 --> 19:13.201
I'll go make the tea now.

19:13.441 --> 19:14.441
No hurry.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.480
Find her a room.

19:16.681 --> 19:17.736
Your Highness, where did you

19:17.760 --> 19:19.000
get this confidante from?

19:19.601 --> 19:20.161
Yu Youwei,

19:20.601 --> 19:21.681
the belle of Zijin Brothel.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.320
Settle her down first.

19:23.681 --> 19:24.080
Yes.

19:24.241 --> 19:27.081
(Wutong House)

19:39.320 --> 19:40.320
Where is my python whip?

19:52.000 --> 19:53.000
Is it this one?

20:00.800 --> 20:01.800
Yes.

20:16.961 --> 20:17.961
How is this room?

20:20.921 --> 20:21.441
Not bad.

20:21.800 --> 20:22.800
What do you think?

20:23.601 --> 20:24.921
It's good as long as you like it.

20:29.681 --> 20:31.281
Bedding should be replaced
with new ones.

20:31.520 --> 20:31.961
OK.

20:32.401 --> 20:33.521
I'll ask them to prepare it.

20:44.841 --> 20:46.320
She looks to be smiling all day.

20:46.520 --> 20:48.120
She is the one
with the deepest thoughts.

20:50.040 --> 20:51.040
Let's get in.

20:51.720 --> 20:52.720
Your Highness, please.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.000
Don't call me that.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.240
I'm Jiang Ni.

20:58.601 --> 21:00.281
There is no princess
after our nation fell.

21:01.201 --> 21:02.560
I know you have something to ask.

21:03.161 --> 21:04.161
Let's talk inside.

21:26.841 --> 21:29.041
General Chu, why are you still
kneeling in my courtyard?

21:29.681 --> 21:30.976
You're not going back to your battalion?

21:31.000 --> 21:32.880
Your Highness, please just call me
Fatty Lushan.

21:33.800 --> 21:34.921
I don't dare to.

21:36.080 --> 21:37.080
If I call you that again,

21:37.201 --> 21:38.361
I won't know

21:38.401 --> 21:39.961
which assassin you'll take me to again.

21:41.320 --> 21:42.320
Your Highness,

21:42.921 --> 21:45.560
I really didn't know that Yu Youwei
was an assassin!

21:49.760 --> 21:51.361
General Chu, you should go back.

21:51.681 --> 21:52.736
I have no official rank

21:52.760 --> 21:53.841
nor military position.

21:55.320 --> 21:55.881
I feel embarrassed

21:55.921 --> 21:58.041
to have a third-ranking officer
kneel in my courtyard.

22:03.201 --> 22:05.480
I'm willing to be punished.

22:15.641 --> 22:17.041
(Ruide Hall)

22:18.441 --> 22:19.641
You'd better think twice.

22:21.961 --> 22:23.560
It's not late to leave now.

22:26.841 --> 22:28.800
I put Your Highness in danger.

22:29.921 --> 22:31.000
I should take punishment.

22:31.401 --> 22:33.560
But it was never planned by me.

22:33.841 --> 22:35.296
I can tell nothing else

22:35.320 --> 22:36.560
even if Your Highness kills me.

22:39.080 --> 22:40.080
Really?

22:43.320 --> 22:44.320
Let me kill you then.

22:51.881 --> 22:53.281
Just ask whatever you want to know.

22:54.080 --> 22:55.080
They all said

22:55.760 --> 22:58.520
Xu Xiao had killed everyone
in the palace.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.480
And…

23:00.841 --> 23:01.240
And…

23:01.760 --> 23:03.201
And beheaded me?

23:04.240 --> 23:05.320
Was it not Xu Xiao?

23:10.480 --> 23:11.480
Back then,

23:12.520 --> 23:14.800
the capital city of Chu was captured
by Xu Xiao,

23:15.681 --> 23:16.776
but his men

23:16.800 --> 23:19.040
never killed prisoners
or hurt civilians.

23:20.441 --> 23:22.857
However, it was not only the
North Liang army that entered the city.

23:22.881 --> 23:24.641
Some of the bigwigs of Liyang

23:25.040 --> 23:26.680
were also waiting
to rush into the palace.

23:27.800 --> 23:28.800
What did they want to do?

23:31.961 --> 23:33.480
The royal concubines of Chu.

23:34.520 --> 23:36.000
The noble status

23:36.520 --> 23:37.841
made them more excited.

23:40.121 --> 23:41.720
What a batch of rascals!

23:42.641 --> 23:43.641
It was Xu Xiao

23:44.601 --> 23:45.641
who closed the palace gate

23:46.240 --> 23:47.240
before anyone else

23:47.681 --> 23:49.000
to prevent others from entering.

23:52.280 --> 23:54.441
But he was not the Emperor of Liyang,

23:55.921 --> 23:57.281
so he couldn't hold back for long.

23:59.080 --> 24:00.161
Then my father

24:01.280 --> 24:02.280
begged to die,

24:04.800 --> 24:05.881
and everyone in the palace

24:06.401 --> 24:07.497
was willing to die with him.

24:07.521 --> 24:09.561
(Palace of West Chu)
(Xuanzheng Hall)

24:10.760 --> 24:13.601
Xu Xiao promised to keep me alive.

24:38.681 --> 24:39.418
(Juvenile Jiang Ni)
Don't look back.

24:39.442 --> 24:41.496
(Juvenile Jiang Ni)

24:41.520 --> 24:42.520
Look forward.

25:03.641 --> 25:04.641
After that day,

25:05.921 --> 25:07.441
the Princess of West Chu died.

25:11.641 --> 25:12.720
Only Jiang Ni is left.

25:24.720 --> 25:25.720
You have been here

25:27.441 --> 25:29.161
among all these years?

25:29.961 --> 25:30.961
Where else can I go?

25:31.881 --> 25:32.881
Have you

25:33.720 --> 25:35.080
never thought of revenge?

25:39.881 --> 25:41.361
I was little back then

25:42.560 --> 25:44.441
and couldn't remember everything.

25:45.040 --> 25:46.040
I just remember

25:47.601 --> 25:48.921
my father stroked my head

25:50.800 --> 25:52.000
and told me to live well.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.240
I see.

26:03.641 --> 26:04.801
What else do you want to ask?

26:13.601 --> 26:14.720
Are you…?

26:15.240 --> 26:16.560
What's that mincement about?

26:17.161 --> 26:18.161
Go ahead.

26:20.441 --> 26:21.961
Are you like the two girls just now?

26:23.080 --> 26:24.080
Like what?

26:26.121 --> 26:27.641
You are all Xu Fengnian's…?

26:30.601 --> 26:32.681
I'm not that kind of maid!

26:33.881 --> 26:35.337
Xu Fengnian didn't…?

26:35.361 --> 26:37.296
He has more than 20 maids

26:37.320 --> 26:38.480
and never touched any of us.

26:38.800 --> 26:39.800
But the rumors said…

26:42.080 --> 26:43.080
The rumors said

26:43.480 --> 26:44.921
Xu Fengnian is a womanizer.

26:46.441 --> 26:48.161
The rumors also said that I was dead.

26:51.361 --> 26:52.361
Alright.

27:13.161 --> 27:18.137
(Ruide Hall)

27:18.161 --> 27:19.161
Dead?

27:21.201 --> 27:22.201
I…

27:22.601 --> 27:23.681
I am still breathing.

27:38.320 --> 27:39.320
My Lord,

27:41.961 --> 27:42.601
the news that

27:42.961 --> 27:44.337
His Highness is whipping General Chu

27:44.361 --> 27:45.361
has been spread.

27:45.441 --> 27:47.161
At the door came many generals

27:47.320 --> 27:48.961
to ask for a meeting.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.240
I won't meet them.

27:52.280 --> 27:52.720
Then…

27:52.921 --> 27:53.280
Then

27:53.681 --> 27:54.681
what about His Highness?

27:57.800 --> 27:58.800
Let him do it.

27:59.280 --> 27:59.601
But

28:01.560 --> 28:02.681
I'm afraid General Chu

28:17.841 --> 28:18.841
Let's talk about you.

28:20.121 --> 28:21.481
Are you still killing Xu Fengnian?

28:26.361 --> 28:27.441
Your accomplices

28:28.441 --> 28:29.441
are also in Lingzhou.

28:30.641 --> 28:32.361
For the sake of Chu,

28:32.720 --> 28:35.280
I'll find a chance for you
to escape and join them.

28:36.800 --> 28:37.800
I don't have accomplices.

28:39.720 --> 28:41.480
Then how did you enter Zijin Brothel

28:42.000 --> 28:43.641
and how did you become the new belle?

28:46.161 --> 28:47.161
I don't know.

28:48.641 --> 28:49.641
Never mind.

28:50.280 --> 28:51.480
I really don't know.

28:52.320 --> 28:54.040
I have been watched among the years

28:54.361 --> 28:55.681
and only dancing.

28:56.480 --> 28:58.760
They told me to prepare for
assassinating Xu Fengnian

28:59.361 --> 29:00.401
and avenging Chu.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.841
Who are they?

29:04.280 --> 29:05.320
I asked before.

29:05.601 --> 29:06.601
They never answered me.

29:08.280 --> 29:09.280
Where were you locked?

29:12.560 --> 29:13.560
It was a big yard

29:14.280 --> 29:15.401
with heavy guard.

29:15.961 --> 29:17.201
I've never left there

29:17.800 --> 29:19.000
so I don't know where it is.

29:22.361 --> 29:24.320
But I could hear chanting sometimes.

29:26.480 --> 29:28.361
What about the people
who took you there?

29:29.520 --> 29:30.520
They left.

29:30.641 --> 29:32.601
They just told me
to wait for Xu Fengnian.

29:33.240 --> 29:34.240
Sounds like

29:35.121 --> 29:36.121
you're just a puppet.

29:39.800 --> 29:40.961
Do you know Chu Lushan?

29:45.361 --> 29:46.361
Never heard of him.

29:47.641 --> 29:48.841
Then why did he

29:49.161 --> 29:50.800
take Xu Fengnian to you?

29:53.841 --> 29:56.137
(Ruide Hall)

29:56.161 --> 29:57.161
Your Highness.

30:03.881 --> 30:04.881
Your Highness.

30:18.161 --> 30:19.681
General Ning Emei
from Fengzi Battalion

30:20.641 --> 30:21.961
shows greetings to Your Highness.

30:28.401 --> 30:29.401
I know you.

30:30.961 --> 30:33.161
You led the troops to pick me up.

30:34.280 --> 30:35.280
Your Highness,

30:35.841 --> 30:37.161
why are you whipping General Chu?

30:39.601 --> 30:41.641
Are you greeting me
or questioning me?

30:43.841 --> 30:44.841
I don't dare to.

30:45.201 --> 30:46.201
I just wonder why.

30:46.881 --> 30:47.897
He took me to the brothel

30:47.921 --> 30:49.121
and I met an assassination.

30:49.240 --> 30:50.240
Can that be a reason?

30:52.000 --> 30:53.000
Has General Chu admitted

30:53.161 --> 30:53.961
that he planned it?

30:54.000 --> 30:55.360
Would you admit it if it were you?

30:55.520 --> 30:56.897
Then, is there any evidence?

30:56.921 --> 30:58.240
No, so what?

30:58.361 --> 30:59.776
It's unreasonable to impose lynching

30:59.800 --> 31:00.800
without evidence.

31:07.641 --> 31:09.320
I remember you were with

31:10.480 --> 31:11.480
your halberd last time.

31:11.760 --> 31:12.880
You don't bring it with you?

31:14.201 --> 31:16.240
I don't dare to meet Your Highness
with that.

31:16.800 --> 31:19.000
It's better to take it with you
when negotiating.

31:19.841 --> 31:20.961
North Liang has its own laws

31:21.601 --> 31:22.881
which don't depend on the weapon

31:23.480 --> 31:24.760
nor superiority and inferiority.

31:35.800 --> 31:36.961
There are laws

31:37.441 --> 31:38.561
and there is no superiority.

31:39.080 --> 31:40.480
Nice speaking.

31:41.961 --> 31:43.041
Your Highness flattered me.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.480
I'm speaking bluntly.

31:45.121 --> 31:46.776
Do you know that even Xu Xiao

31:46.800 --> 31:48.776
doesn't dare to speak to me like that?

31:48.800 --> 31:50.240
Who do you think you are?

31:53.841 --> 31:55.081
I'm Ning Emei, Military General

31:56.040 --> 31:57.040
from Fengzi Battalion.

31:59.280 --> 32:00.280
Alright,

32:02.320 --> 32:03.480
I bear you in mind.

32:05.560 --> 32:07.480
The laws won't work. What to do?

32:07.520 --> 32:08.121
Your Highness, please think twice.

32:08.161 --> 32:08.641
Think about what?

32:08.681 --> 32:09.681
If you let the army down,

32:09.800 --> 32:11.320
no rule will work in the three states.

32:12.040 --> 32:13.040
When the time comes,

32:13.841 --> 32:16.241
can Your Highness still be able to
be in charge of Xu's army?

32:20.441 --> 32:21.441
Guard!

32:21.720 --> 32:24.040
Take this rebel to prison!

32:28.121 --> 32:29.921
Whether it's planned by Chu Lushan
or not,

32:31.720 --> 32:32.720
your assassination

32:33.760 --> 32:34.760
is not that easy.

32:38.121 --> 32:40.201
You were only taught with sword dance

32:40.401 --> 32:41.921
but no fighting skills.

32:43.881 --> 32:45.841
If they really wanted you
to kill Xu Fengnian,

32:46.441 --> 32:47.441
that's

32:47.961 --> 32:49.000
unreasonable.

32:51.961 --> 32:53.401
What do they want then?

32:54.601 --> 32:56.681
Xu Fengnian was also assassinated

32:57.320 --> 32:58.760
by Chu people on his way back.

33:00.161 --> 33:01.681
Was it related to my assassination?

33:03.121 --> 33:04.121
I don't know.

33:05.401 --> 33:07.520
But I feel that this is not done yet.

33:10.361 --> 33:12.361
It's fine as long as Your Highness
is not involved.

33:12.401 --> 33:13.881
I told you not to call me that again.

33:14.921 --> 33:15.921
I'm leaving.

33:15.961 --> 33:17.121
Please don't get angry.

33:17.601 --> 33:18.800
I'm not angry.

33:20.161 --> 33:21.240
I need to work.

33:22.320 --> 33:23.617
The books in his room

33:23.641 --> 33:24.776
need to be dried every month.

33:24.800 --> 33:25.800
So annoying.

33:58.641 --> 33:59.641
My Lord,

34:03.760 --> 34:05.080
His Highness is sending Ning Emei

34:06.320 --> 34:07.320
to the prison.

34:11.841 --> 34:12.841
Alright.

34:16.401 --> 34:17.401
His Highness

34:17.961 --> 34:20.080
told the maid to send a message
to the gate.

34:20.680 --> 34:21.680
What is it?

34:26.321 --> 34:27.321
His Highness said

34:27.680 --> 34:29.377
Ning Emei came to negotiate

34:29.401 --> 34:30.640
and is in prison now.

34:31.480 --> 34:33.441
If anyone of you still wants
to help Chu Lushan,

34:33.841 --> 34:34.841
don't kneel here

35:06.641 --> 35:10.521
and come directly in.

35:17.841 --> 35:18.841
My Lord,

35:19.721 --> 35:20.721
Chen Zhibao is here.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.480
Now

35:26.801 --> 35:28.160
he is heading to His Highness.

35:33.600 --> 35:34.600
I got it.

35:38.921 --> 35:39.921
It's cold.

35:39.961 --> 35:40.961
Alright,

35:41.801 --> 35:42.801
I'll change it right now.

36:02.600 --> 36:03.600
His Highness,

36:03.640 --> 36:04.761
Chen Zhibao is coming.

36:07.680 --> 36:08.680
White Chen?

36:10.160 --> 36:11.160
You know him?

36:11.921 --> 36:13.361
Chen Zhibao, War Immortal in White.

36:13.961 --> 36:14.961
Xu Xiao's henchman.

36:15.721 --> 36:16.817
The top general in North Liang

36:16.841 --> 36:18.241
and the top one of the Adopted Six.

36:18.680 --> 36:19.881
The backbone of North Liang.

36:20.600 --> 36:21.600
It's said that

36:21.801 --> 36:23.640
he is the only one capable to take over

36:24.441 --> 36:25.481
North Liang after Xu Xiao.

36:25.680 --> 36:27.337
Sounds like there is nothing
to do with me.

36:27.361 --> 36:28.361
You're also well-known.

36:29.040 --> 36:30.560
Chen Zhibao is the hope of North Liang

36:31.040 --> 36:32.520
and you are the shame of North Liang.

36:32.600 --> 36:33.600
You're both famous.

36:39.000 --> 36:40.000
Have some tea

36:40.721 --> 36:42.000
and wait for White Chen.

37:32.121 --> 37:33.241
(Ruide Hall)

37:39.000 --> 37:40.120
Don't stand in the way.

37:40.560 --> 37:41.761
I can't even see him.

37:52.200 --> 37:53.640
You're also here to persuade me?

37:54.640 --> 37:55.640
Chu Lushan is

37:56.281 --> 37:58.281
the general I look down upon the most.

37:58.761 --> 37:59.761
I have told them

37:59.921 --> 38:00.680
that one day

38:00.881 --> 38:02.680
I will send him to hell.

38:03.640 --> 38:04.880
If you really want to kill him,

38:05.040 --> 38:06.040
I can do it for you.

38:06.560 --> 38:07.560
The problem is,

38:09.160 --> 38:10.400
do you really want to kill him?

38:27.040 --> 38:28.040
What is it?

38:31.241 --> 38:32.241
Head.

38:33.560 --> 38:35.040
The person who gave your portrait out

38:35.120 --> 38:36.881
and sent the belle

38:37.281 --> 38:38.281
to the brothel.

38:40.600 --> 38:41.600
Who is it?

38:42.160 --> 38:43.160
A military officer.

38:44.120 --> 38:45.120
You don't know him.

38:46.241 --> 38:47.520
Only an officer

38:47.721 --> 38:49.120
can make such big trouble?

38:54.321 --> 38:55.801
That's interesting.

38:56.761 --> 38:57.761
He is the most brutal

38:58.120 --> 39:00.480
and ridiculous one among the generals.

39:01.361 --> 39:03.160
But this devil happens to be

39:04.281 --> 39:05.921
most loyal to you.

39:07.600 --> 39:08.801
I guess you whipped him

39:09.441 --> 39:11.680
just to show the North Liang army.

39:11.881 --> 39:12.680
In that way,

39:12.801 --> 39:14.321
if someone wants to harm you,

39:14.841 --> 39:16.160
the first choice to draw over

39:16.761 --> 39:19.120
is the resentful Chu Lushan.

39:20.841 --> 39:22.241
And you're also waiting.

39:23.441 --> 39:25.000
The one who comes to save him

39:25.801 --> 39:27.160
may be the murderer

39:27.361 --> 39:29.160
who planned to kill you.

39:32.241 --> 39:33.241
What a coincidence.

39:34.120 --> 39:35.200
You're here now.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.080
That's a harsh whip.

39:40.721 --> 39:41.721
It's hard for him

39:41.881 --> 39:43.361
to suffer for you.

39:45.040 --> 39:46.560
Your Highness, please whip hard

39:47.721 --> 39:49.361
later when you punish me.

39:50.241 --> 39:51.361
It has to be hard enough

39:52.321 --> 39:53.321
to be believed by others.

39:54.560 --> 39:56.000
If you want to fish,

39:57.241 --> 39:59.000
the bait must be put enough.

40:02.080 --> 40:03.120
Your Highness.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.160
Let's have a word alone.

40:22.841 --> 40:23.560
They all say

40:23.600 --> 40:24.401
you should be the one

40:24.441 --> 40:25.721
to take over North Liang.

40:26.721 --> 40:27.721
In contrast,

40:28.480 --> 40:29.840
I, the son of Lord of North Liang,

40:30.120 --> 40:31.401
am treated as a joke by others.

40:34.281 --> 40:35.640
What do you think?

40:40.000 --> 40:41.441
Didn't you ask for a talk?

40:42.281 --> 40:43.281
Why don't you speak?

40:45.160 --> 40:46.241
Did you question the belle?

40:47.921 --> 40:50.000
She grew up being raised in a mansion,

40:50.321 --> 40:51.601
practicing sword dance every day

40:51.921 --> 40:53.241
just to stab me with that sword.

40:54.120 --> 40:55.520
She doesn't know

40:55.560 --> 40:56.801
who raised her.

40:57.441 --> 40:58.441
She was just sent there.

41:00.441 --> 41:01.441
Kill her.

41:01.921 --> 41:02.921
No way.

41:04.200 --> 41:05.361
She is pretty.

41:06.721 --> 41:07.761
You can go meet her.

41:07.921 --> 41:08.921
Maybe you will like her.

41:12.841 --> 41:14.201
The assassination outside the city

41:14.401 --> 41:15.401
and the sword dance

41:16.241 --> 41:18.801
were just to make you suspect that
a rebel is hiding in the army.

41:19.600 --> 41:21.281
You already fell into the trap

41:21.600 --> 41:23.200
when you used Chu Lushan
to find him out.

41:23.520 --> 41:24.520
Once you feel suspicious,

41:25.441 --> 41:26.801
the army will be in a mess.

41:29.200 --> 41:30.200
Kill that belle,

41:30.761 --> 41:32.081
together with the officer's head,

41:32.600 --> 41:35.160
so that the whole matter can be over.

41:36.401 --> 41:37.480
Over?

41:39.361 --> 41:40.681
That means no more investigation?

41:42.721 --> 41:44.001
We should keep on investigating,

41:44.520 --> 41:45.520
but on the surface,

41:46.080 --> 41:47.080
this is over.

41:48.721 --> 41:49.721
So, that officer

41:49.841 --> 41:50.961
was not the murderer.

41:51.441 --> 41:53.241
Just to end it on the surface,

41:53.441 --> 41:54.801
he was beheaded.

41:56.401 --> 41:57.401
He broke the military law

41:58.080 --> 41:59.560
and had long been sentenced to death.

42:00.281 --> 42:01.481
He had been sentenced to death

42:02.281 --> 42:03.281
but he died now

42:04.520 --> 42:05.721
just to end this up?

42:07.160 --> 42:08.881
How many endings like this
are you hiding?

42:11.120 --> 42:12.720
There are internal
and external problems.

42:12.881 --> 42:14.121
The three states of North Liang

42:14.640 --> 42:15.640
can't be in a mess.

42:17.560 --> 42:18.961
That's why you, Chen Zhibao,

42:20.241 --> 42:22.761
are the backbone of North Liang.

42:26.640 --> 42:27.640
Yes,

42:28.361 --> 42:29.361
I am.

42:36.801 --> 42:37.881
I just told you

42:39.401 --> 42:40.761
that the belle is pretty.

42:42.721 --> 42:44.480
I'm reluctant to kill her.

42:49.520 --> 42:50.520
What to do now?

44:56.841 --> 45:00.681
♪ The flower of pain ♪
